Takauji was unable to have the position of Seii Taishogun ( literally , `` great general who subdues the barbarians '' ) by Emperor Godaigo , and on September 2 of the same year , he left Kamakura without receiving an imperial letter , and Emperor Godaigo was forced to give the title of Seii Taishogun ( literally , `` great general who subdues the eastern barbarians '' ) .
