In December of the same year , Takauji reported to the Emperor Godaigo as the <unk> of Yoshisada NITTA , but Emperor Godaigo ordered Yoshisada to subjugate Takauji and sent him to Kamakura .
In addition , Akiie KITABATAKE started to advance south from Oshu , and Takauji announced that he would be pardoned , but when Tadayoshi and KO no Moronao started to retire in various places such as Mikawa Province , Takauji decided to rebel against the Kenmu government .
In December of the same year , Takauji defeated the Nitta army in the Battle of Hakone and <unk> , and began to advance to Kyoto .
During this period , Takauji made a connection with Emperor Kogon of the Jimyoin line and made efforts to gain the legitimacy of the advance of Kyoto .
Takauji entered the capital in January , 1324 , and Emperor Godaigo retreated to Mt. Hiei .
However , Takauji met Akiie KITABATAKE and Yoshisada NITTA who went to the capital from Oshu ( Northern Honshu , the region of Japan , particularly Kanto region ) , and in February of the same year , he abandoned Kyoto and went down to Kyushu with Enshin AKAMATSU 's advice .
On the way to Kyushu , he was welcomed by Shigefusa SHONI in <unk> , Nagato Province ( Shimonoseki City , Yamaguchi Prefecture ) , and was supported by the chief priest of Munakata Taisha Shrine in Munakata , Chikuzen Province .
In the early March after visiting Munakata Taisha Shrine , Takauji , who defeated the Emperor Godaigo 's army in the Battle of <unk> ( Higashi Ward , Fukuoka City ) in the Battle of <unk> ( Higashi Ward , Fukuoka City ) , gained the command of the Retired Emperor Kogon on the way to Kyoto , and brought up the Retired Emperor Kogon 's command to the western part again .
In the Battle of Minatogawa on April 25 of the same year , he defeated Yoshisada NITTA and Masashige KUSUNOKI , and conquered Kyoto again in June of the same year .
Takauji , who went to Kyoto , proposed a peace agreement with Emperor Godaigo who had fled to Mt. Hiei .
In response to peace negotiations , Emperor Godaigo handed over the sacred treasures to the Emperor Komyo , the younger brother of the Retired Emperor Kogon , and immediately after that , on December 7 of the same year , Takauji decided to establish the basic policy of the Kenmu Code and declared the establishment of a new samurai government .
On the other hand , in December of the same year , Emperor Godaigo escaped from Kyoto and escaped to Yoshino ( Yoshino Town , Yoshino County , Nara Prefecture ) , and the sacred treasures that he handed over to Komyo were false , and established the Yoshino Court .
In 1338 , Takauji was appointed Seii Taishogun by the Emperor Komyo ( in office , 1338 - 1358 ) , and the samurai government that later became the Muromachi bakufu ( Japanese feudal government headed by a shogun ) was established in name and reality .
In the following year , when Emperor Godaigo died in Yoshino , Takauji started the construction of Tenryu-ji Temple to pray for his soul .
In order to <unk> the construction cost , Tenryu-ji Temple was dispatched to Yuan ( dynasty ) .
In the new government , Takauji left the government to Tadayoshi , and he himself ruled as the leader of samurai .
